{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>AltErgoLib.Fpa_rounding</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"alt-ergo-lib","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"AltErgoLib","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Fpa_rounding","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-DE\"><a href=\"#module-DE\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> DE</span><span> = <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Dolmen</span>.Std.Expr</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-rounding_mode\"><a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> rounding_mode</span><span> = <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Dolmen</span>.Std.Builtin.Float.rounding_mode</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>We reuse Dolmen's own representation of the rounding modes.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compare_rounding_mode\"><a href=\"#val-compare_rounding_mode\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compare_rounding_mode : <span><a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\">rounding_mode</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\">rounding_mode</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fpa_rounding_mode_type_name\"><a href=\"#val-fpa_rounding_mode_type_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fpa_rounding_mode_type_name : string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Equal to <code>&quot;RoundingMode&quot;</code>, the SMT2 type of rounding modes.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fpa_rounding_mode_ae_type_name\"><a href=\"#val-fpa_rounding_mode_ae_type_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fpa_rounding_mode_ae_type_name : string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Equal to <code>&quot;fpa_rounding_mode&quot;</code>, the Alt-Ergo native rounding mode type.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fpa_rounding_mode_dty\"><a href=\"#val-fpa_rounding_mode_dty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fpa_rounding_mode_dty : <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Dolmen</span>.Std.Expr.Ty.t</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The Dolmen rounding mode type.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-d_constrs\"><a href=\"#val-d_constrs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> d_constrs : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">DE</span>.term_cst list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The Dolmen constructors of <code>rounding_mode</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fpa_rounding_mode\"><a href=\"#val-fpa_rounding_mode\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fpa_rounding_mode : <a href=\"../Ty/index.html#type-t\">Ty.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The rounding mode type.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-rounding_mode_of_smt\"><a href=\"#val-rounding_mode_of_smt\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> rounding_mode_of_smt : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\">rounding_mode</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Transforms the string corresponding to a RoundingMode element into the <code>rounding_mode</code> equivalent. Raises 'Failure' if the string does not correspond to a valid rounding mode.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-rounding_mode_of_ae\"><a href=\"#val-rounding_mode_of_ae\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> rounding_mode_of_ae : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\">rounding_mode</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Same, but for legacy's <code>rounding_mode</code> equivalent.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-translate_smt_rounding_mode\"><a href=\"#val-translate_smt_rounding_mode\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> translate_smt_rounding_mode : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Same, but from AE modes to SMT2 modes.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-string_of_rounding_mode\"><a href=\"#val-string_of_rounding_mode\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> string_of_rounding_mode : <span><a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\">rounding_mode</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Returns the string representation of the <code>rounding_mode</code> (SMT2 standard)</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-term_cst_of_rounding_mode\"><a href=\"#val-term_cst_of_rounding_mode\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> term_cst_of_rounding_mode : <span><a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\">rounding_mode</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Dolmen</span>.Std.Expr.term_cst</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Returns the Dolmen constructor associated with the rounding mode.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-integer_log_2\"><a href=\"#val-integer_log_2\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> integer_log_2 : <span><a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Integer part of binary logarithm for NON-ZERO POSITIVE number *</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-mult_x_by_2_pow_n\"><a href=\"#val-mult_x_by_2_pow_n\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> mult_x_by_2_pow_n : <span><a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>mult_x_by_2_pow_n x n</code> is <code>x * 2^n</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-float_of_rational\"><a href=\"#val-float_of_rational\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> float_of_rational : \u000A  <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\">rounding_mode</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a> * <a href=\"../Numbers/Z/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Z.t</a> * int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>float_of_rational prec exp mode x</code> float approx of a rational constant. The function also returns the mantissa and the exponent. i.e. if <code>res, m, e = float_of_rational prec exp mode x</code>, then <code>res = m * 2^e</code> *</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-round\"><a href=\"#val-round\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> round : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\">rounding_mode</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>round prec exp mode x</code> is the first component of <code>float_of_rational prec exp mode x</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-succ\"><a href=\"#val-succ\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> succ : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>succ prec exp x</code> is the next float of the format after <code>x</code>, which must be a float of the format.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pred\"><a href=\"#val-pred\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pred : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>pred prec exp x</code> is the float of the format before <code>x</code>, which must be a float of the format.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-round_to_integer\"><a href=\"#val-round_to_integer\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> round_to_integer : <span><a href=\"#type-rounding_mode\">rounding_mode</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Numbers/Q/index.html#type-t\">Numbers.Q.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>round_to_integer mode x</code> rounds the rational <code>x</code> to an integer depending on the rounding mode <code>mode</code></p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-empty_cache\"><a href=\"#val-empty_cache\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> empty_cache : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Empties the module's inner cache</p></div></div>"}